    "definition_type_raw": null,
    "source_book_raw": "Heroes from the Fringe pg. 21",
    "definition_raw": "Source Heroes from the Fringe pg. 21\nOften having one parent with a human lifespan and one with an elven lifespan, many half-elves have a skewed perception of time, and none more so than the Spireborn, who also study the subject of time academically.\n\nPrerequisites: Character level 5th, Spireborn half-elf.\n\nBenefit: Once per day, as a standard action, you can gain the benefits of haste until the end of your next turn.",
